<title>SPAIN: Fenosa wins 725 mln pta Latam contract.</title>
<headline>Fenosa wins 725 mln pta Latam contract.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity company Union Fenosa said on Friday its Union Fenosa Acex unit had won a 725 million peseta ($5 million) contract in collaboration with Aguas de Valencia.</p>
<p>The contract is to modernise a drinking and waste water treatment firm in Costa Rica, and should take around 18 months.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340 ($ = 145.8 Spanish Pesetas)</p>
